{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:05 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"周俊樂策呂廄「做好自己」以大熱身分掄元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/247abc7c7899e4d937e51471a8e11d2e/2026-11/m2_0.jpg\"/><p>早前周俊樂騎「一生好彩」時觸犯不小心策騎，被判罰停賽兩日及罰款六萬元，騎者就裁決及停賽，但不就罰款，提出上訴；馬會董事局已批准暫緩其處罰。而周俊樂未有因此事影響表現，今晚第七場策呂廄「做好自己」以大熱身分掄元，連贏四日且季內累積十六場頭馬。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.095862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:42.476011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:33.246074+00:00","content_hash":"974c839e4fc5ed4cd74d477dff25d134d202e48ef81a37345c553bc7e45e99e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}